WEBVTT

00:01:26.382 --> 00:01:28.106
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> Well, you know what you have to do.

00:01:28.784 --> 00:01:29.858
You should apologize.

00:01:30.776 --> 00:01:32.119
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> I have apologized!

00:01:32.261 --> 00:01:33.535
But she doesn’t listen to me.

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:35.738
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> Izzy’s angry.

00:01:36.064 --> 00:01:37.226
Of course she’s angry.

00:01:37.681 --> 00:01:39.971
She probably thinks that you don’t trust her.

00:01:40.654 --> 00:01:43.242
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> I trust her! Of course I trust her.

00:01:46.719 --> 00:01:48.047
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> Do you trust her?

00:01:48.784 --> 00:01:49.424
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yes.

00:01:50.259 --> 00:01:52.178
Nothing happened between her and Max.

00:01:52.803 --> 00:01:54.048
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> But do you believe her?

00:01:54.478 --> 00:01:54.986
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yeah!

00:01:55.581 --> 00:01:57.739
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> Or do you just want to believe her?

00:01:59.966 --> 00:02:00.601
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> What do you mean?

00:02:01.646 --> 00:02:03.462
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> You think she’s going to break up with you.

00:02:04.141 --> 00:02:06.070
That she might be happier without you.

00:02:06.674 --> 00:02:08.354
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> No, I don’t.

00:02:08.901 --> 00:02:12.992
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> Or maybe, just maybe, you think you might be happier without her.

00:02:14.775 --> 00:02:18.950
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> I…no, that’s not true.

00:02:18.964 --> 00:02:20.082
I want to stay with her.

00:02:20.644 --> 00:02:21.796
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> Then you’ll have to change.

00:02:22.406 --> 00:02:24.315
But do you want to change?

00:02:28.241 --> 00:02:28.651
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> No.

00:02:38.583 --> 00:02:39.125
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Ben.

00:02:42.489 --> 00:02:44.012
Love is sometimes hard work.

00:02:45.629 --> 00:02:47.533
Things don’t always go to plan.

00:02:49.594 --> 00:02:50.512
People change.

00:02:52.377 --> 00:02:56.073
But it’s always worth it if it’s the right person.

00:02:58.481 --> 00:02:59.755
So ask yourself this:

00:03:02.011 --> 00:03:03.173
am I the right person?

00:03:08.222 --> 00:03:10.112
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> I don’t know anymore.